{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"No—the dataset does not establish that it shipped in any release.\n\nThe SIG agreed to merge the OTelConf RC-support PR as-is, pending normal review, but the authoritative release work state remains `in_progress` and says the final merge/delivery is not present in the evidence package. [WS-04: Release Process, `SRC-NOTE-07`] The underlying meeting note also records that the release was blocked on review of that PR. [OpenTelemetry Go SIG meeting note, 2025-11-20, `SRC-NOTE-07`]"}}
